OL,3,A'I wouldn't be here today without you':
OL,4,AStudent's praise for man who stopped
OL,5,Atrain attacker
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe then 19-year-old and 61-year-old
OL,8,FCrean were just strangers on a train
OL,9,Fwhen she ran down the carriage
OL,10,Fscreaming that there was a man with a
OL,11,Fknife.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
