OL,3,AWeary of war but with no sign of
OL,4,Abacking down, Kyiv faces another
OL,5,Apunishing winter
OL,6,
OL,7,FWeary of war but with no sign of
OL,8,Fbacking down, Kyiv faces another
OL,9,Fpunishing winter
OL,11,FSomething weird happens when you reach
OL,12,FKyiv after the eight-hour drive from
OL,13,Fthe Polish border: the clock on your
OL,14,Fmobile phone goes to midnight. It's not
OL,15,Freally for phones - it seems to be part
OL,16,Fof a wider strategy to disorient the
OL,17,Fmissiles and drones the Russians are
OL,18,Fsending over.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
