OL,3,AKenyan doomsday cult leader convicted
OL,4,Aover further 123 deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FMackenzie had pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fmanslaughter and one of his lawyers
OL,8,Fsaid he would appeal against the
OL,9,Fconviction after sentencing, Reuters
OL,10,Fnews agency reports.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
